cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PlotDigitizer in research, please cite this repository and record
  the release tag or commit you used. Cite source figures separately.
type: software
title: "PlotDigitizer: Offline plot digitization for spectroscopy"
authors:
  - name: unwatcher
    website: "https://github.com/unwatcher"
repository-code: "https://github.com/unwatcher/Plot_Digitizer"
url: "https://github.com/unwatcher/Plot_Digitizer"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Offline scientific plot digitizer for PXRD, Raman and infrared spectroscopy,
  with OCR-assisted axis calibration, reviewable automatic curve extraction,
  CSV/JSON and XRDML export, and a local REST API.
keywords:
  - plot digitizer
  - spectroscopy
  - PXRD
  - Raman spectroscopy
  - infrared spectroscopy
  - XRDML
  - scientific software
